    "Open the OneStopShop website already available in Chrome.",
    "Search for the matching French Provence Lavender product.",
    "Use Narrator to review the search results and product details.",
    "Open the French Provence Lavender with blue flowers, supplied as one live plant in a 2.5-quart pot.",
    "Set the quantity to 2 and add the product to the shopping cart.",
    "Open the shopping cart.",
    "Expand the coupon or discount section if necessary.",
    "Enter LAVENDER20 in the coupon code field.",
    "Do not apply the coupon.",
    "Leave the shopping cart page open."
